#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:7
msgid "Joint Wrench Sensor"
msgstr "关节力旋量传感器"

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:9
msgid ""
"A :class:`~sensors.JointWrenchSensor` reports the incoming reaction wrench "
"at each selected articulation body's parent joint. It exposes force [N] and "
"torque [N·m] separately, with entries ordered by "
":attr:`~sensors.JointWrenchSensor.body_names`."
msgstr ""
":class:`~sensors.JointWrenchSensor` 报告每个所选关节体刚体的父关节处传入的反作用力旋量。力 [N] 和力矩 "
"[N·m] 分别提供，各条目按 :attr:`~sensors.JointWrenchSensor.body_names` 排列。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:14
msgid "Wrench convention"
msgstr "力旋量约定"

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:16
msgid ""
"The ``incoming_joint_frame`` convention expresses the wrench in the child-"
"side joint frame at the child-side joint anchor. This matches the placement "
"of a six-axis force/torque sensor mounted at the joint. Backend "
"implementations convert their native solver output to this common "
"convention."
msgstr ""
"``incoming_joint_frame`` "
"约定在子侧关节锚点处、以子侧关节坐标系表示力旋量。这与安装在关节处的六轴力/力矩传感器的位置相符。各后端实现会将求解器原生输出转换为这一统一约定。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:20
msgid ""
"PhysX's ``get_link_incoming_joint_force()`` already returns the wrench in "
"the child-side joint frame, referenced at its anchor, so the PhysX sensor "
"exposes those components directly. Applying the USD ``localPos1`` and "
"``localRot1`` again would shift and rotate the wrench twice."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 的 ``get_link_incoming_joint_force()`` 返回的力旋量已经以子侧关节坐标系表示，并以其锚点为参考点，因此 "
"PhysX 传感器直接提供这些分量。再次应用 USD 的 ``localPos1`` 和 ``localRot1`` 会重复平移和旋转该力旋量。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:25
msgid "Configure the sensor"
msgstr "配置传感器"

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:27
msgid ""
"Set :attr:`~sensors.JointWrenchSensorCfg.prim_path` to the articulation "
"root. Reported body coverage depends on the physics backend:"
msgstr ""
"将 :attr:`~sensors.JointWrenchSensorCfg.prim_path` 设为关节体根节点。报告的刚体范围取决于物理后端："

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:30
msgid ""
"PhysX and OVPhysX report every articulation link, including the root link."
msgstr "PhysX 和 OVPhysX 报告所有关节体连杆，包括根连杆。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:31
msgid ""
"Newton reports the child link of each non-free joint in the articulation "
"tree, including fixed connections between bodies such as a welded wrist "
"sensor or tool flange. Free joints, fixed joints to the world, and loop-"
"closing constraints are excluded. The reported wrench at a weld includes the"
" loads transmitted by its child subtree, even though the joint has no "
"degrees of freedom."
msgstr ""
"Newton "
"报告关节体树中每个非自由关节的子连杆，包括刚体间的固定连接，例如焊接的腕部传感器或工具法兰。不包括自由关节、与世界相连的固定关节，以及闭环约束。即使焊接关节没有自由度，其报告的力旋量仍包含由子树传递的负载。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:36
msgid ""
"Use :attr:`~sensors.JointWrenchSensor.body_names` or "
":meth:`~sensors.JointWrenchSensor.find_bodies` instead of assuming that "
"different backends expose the same number or order of entries:"
msgstr ""
"请使用 :attr:`~sensors.JointWrenchSensor.body_names` 或 "
":meth:`~sensors.JointWrenchSensor.find_bodies` ，不要假定不同后端提供相同数量或顺序的条目："

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:45
msgid ""
"Manager-based environments can select a body subset through "
":class:`~isaaclab.managers.SceneEntityCfg` and use "
":func:`~isaaclab.envs.mdp.body_incoming_wrench` as an observation term:"
msgstr ""
"基于管理器的环境可以通过 :class:`~isaaclab.managers.SceneEntityCfg` 选择刚体子集，并使用 "
":func:`~isaaclab.envs.mdp.body_incoming_wrench` 作为观测项："

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:55
msgid "Read the data"
msgstr "读取数据"

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:57
msgid ""
"For ``E`` environments and ``B`` reported bodies, ``force.torch`` and "
"``torque.torch`` each have shape ``(E, B, 3)``. Both buffers are ``None`` "
"before simulation initialization."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``E`` 个环境和 ``B`` 个报告的刚体， ``force.torch`` 和 ``torque.torch`` 的形状均为 ``(E, "
"B, 3)`` 。两个缓冲区在仿真初始化前均为 ``None`` 。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/joint_wrench_sensor.rst:69
msgid ""
"The composed ``wrench`` has shape ``(E, num_selected_bodies, 6)`` with force"
" components followed by torque components. ``B`` and the entry ordering can "
"differ between backends."
msgstr ""
"组合后的 ``wrench`` 形状为 ``(E, num_selected_bodies, 6)`` ，力分量在前，力矩分量在后。 ``B`` "
"及条目的排列顺序可能因后端而异。"
